    "body": "Merged `origin/main` into `issue/2019-lathe-gizmo`. The new head is `4ed48f68f`. The old head was `6a800e5ce`.\n\nConflicting files and resolution:\n- `crates/ui/src/interact.rs` (three hunks: `overlay_labels`, `gizmo_segments`, `collect_overlay`): keep both sides. Each axis loop first skips an axis that is not shown (`if !shown[axis] { continue; }`, this PR). Then it applies the WCS axis flip (`let dir = gizmo.axis_dir(axis, dir);`, from main). The two changes are independent.\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs`: keep both sides. The module list has `mod lathe_gizmo;` (this PR) and `mod floor;` (from main).\n\nNo hand edits outside the conflict markers. `git diff origin/main --stat` lists only the five files of this PR. All files keep LF line ends.\n\nTargeted gate: `cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main`, 11 steps, 0 failed. `camcraft-ui` lib: 1049 passed, 0 failed, 6 ignored. This includes the five `egui_app::tests::lathe_gizmo::*` tests. The suites `boundary`, `boundary_picks`, `edge_loop_pick`, `operations`, `sinker_setup`, `tap_hand`, `theme_example`, `theme_files` and `waterjet_tool` pass. GitHub reports MERGEABLE. I removed the `conflicts` label.\n\nready for a re-check\n",
